    <briefdescription>
<para>Manages MQTT connection and communication with HiveMQ Cloud broker. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class handles all MQTT operations including:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Secure connection to HiveMQ Cloud broker</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Auto-reconnection on connection loss</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Message publishing to hardcoded topic</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Message subscription with callback handling</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Verbose debug output for troubleshooting </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
